                Program Development -- Hints and Advice




                           Installation and


             Daily Usage of Translator and Class Libraries









         __AA__bb__ss__tt__rr__aa__cc__tt        

         This  document  describes  how  to  use  the  Object  C
         Translator   on   a   daily   basis.    It  charts  the
         development   of   a   user   class   and   a  matching
         application.   Installation  is outlined.  The Object C
         Translator  is based on a system similar to Objective-C
         as  outlined  by  Brad  Cox [Cox86].  A bibliography of
         related materials is also included.  








